{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》即將於翡翠台首播，主要演員包括：楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳自瑤、鄺潔楹等。</p><p>總監製鍾澍佳（佳導）及監製任海曜（任導）率領4位主演楊茜堯、陳豪、姚子羚Elaine及傅嘉莉Kelly出席看片會。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:49.768741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:46:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:38:56.045126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:10.373760+00:00","content_hash":"ff9d43f5ba2ad57a0f727667f39b5497edf36a4c34bcb976083225320db892be","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}